    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. some of the local news coverage i've seen makes it sound like these complaints are just people being selfish or \"NIMBYs\" who just don't want change. from a planning perspective, are these arguments actually based on anything substantive, or is it mostly just people reacting emotionally to something new?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
